      <!-- Embedded Localized Google Play Deployment Release Notes Block -->
      <app:releaseNotes>
        <en-US>
• Added native runtime support for all Google Testing Programs (including Closed Tracks, Internal Tracks, Open Beta, and Pre-Registration campaigns).
• Implemented an intelligent Hardware Profiler Matrix: users on Android devices can instantly launch testing tracks or live apps, while non-Android visitors see clean, streamlined status pages.
• Refined the "Completed" testing track state to safely lock workspace navigation while providing Android users with a direct "Launch URL" link to keep interacting with the application.
• Added localized density alert tags to dynamically flag tracks requiring immediate testing reinforcement to clear Google's 20-tester minimums.
• Resolved timeline calculation overflows to ensure active counters accurately represent track limits without scaling errors.
        </en-US>
      </app:releaseNotes>
